    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/6a376db41c201ea8cde992dfcf70062c.avif?t=1755431414\" data-has-big width=800 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>3D anime</strong> game based on <strong>exhibitionism.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/07d250fe9873b602c7968a1b707eafc3.poster.avif?t=1755431414\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/07d250fe9873b602c7968a1b707eafc3.webm?t=1755431414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/07d250fe9873b602c7968a1b707eafc3.mp4?t=1755431414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><strong>Roxanne\u00a0</strong>was a\u00a0shy\u00a0and\u00a0reserved\u00a0girl, but she had a secret passion that made her feel alive:\u00a0<strong>she loved exhibitionism.</strong></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>She loved the\u00a0<strong>feeling of freedom</strong>\u00a0she felt when she walked\u00a0<strong>naked\u00a0</strong>down the street, feeling seen by anyone who passed by.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Of course, it wasn't an easy thing to do. She had to be very\u00a0<strong>careful\u00a0</strong>and always take the necessary\u00a0precautions\u00a0not to be\u00a0<strong>caught</strong>. But Roxanne knew it was something she wanted to do. And so she continued to do it, more and more often.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/e4dec98000f1f175f8810f602d3a8daa.poster.avif?t=1755431414\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/e4dec98000f1f175f8810f602d3a8daa.webm?t=1755431414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/e4dec98000f1f175f8810f602d3a8daa.mp4?t=1755431414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/ff2ceb70169cc5504c3e428021785bf7.avif?t=1755431414\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play as Roxanne, an exhibitionist girl!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 maps</strong> to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than <strong>66 clothes already available</strong> in the game including: <strong>underwear, swimsuits, accessories, shoes and more.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character customization</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exp earning system with <strong>quests</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hot live streaming money earning system</strong>, the more you <strong>expose yourself</strong> the more you earn!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo mode.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of <strong>secret images</strong> to unlock.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An entire <strong>in-game social network</strong> where you can <strong>post photos.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secondary characters</strong> you can interact with.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Much more!</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/f8097eb48fb7f3b4b6dba67278ea018e.poster.avif?t=1755431414\" width=800 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/f8097eb48fb7f3b4b6dba67278ea018e.webm?t=1755431414\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3552790/extras/f8097eb48fb7f3b4b6dba67278ea018e.mp4?t=1755431414\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Info</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a game based on <strong>exhibitionism </strong>and <strong>humiliation</strong>. Sex is not part of the foundation of the genre so <strong>it is not currently included</strong>.</p>",
